msgstr ""
"Ställs in av alternativet :option:`\\-O` och "
"miljövariabeln :envvar:`PYTHONOPTIMIZE`."

#: ../../c-api/interp-lifecycle.rst:308
msgid ""
"This API is kept for backward compatibility: "
"setting :c:member:`PyConfig.quiet` should be used instead, see :ref:`Python "
